{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25400","headline":"秋日登郡楼望赞皇山感而成咏 · 李德裕","name":"秋日登郡楼望赞皇山感而成咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔人怀井邑，爲有挂冠期。\n顾我飘蓬者，长随泛梗移。\n越吟因病感，潘鬓入秋悲。\n北指邯郸道，应无归去期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25400.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25400","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}